    {
      "id": "u_a5671db810b22d6361a59ef1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium is a node.js application. Supported (tested) version of node.js is latest 14.X.X and 16.X.X. Trilium might work with older versions as well.",
      "sourceHash": "a5671db810b22d6361a59ef184bd33df75071639be6d212d8e8ea2006c86208a",
      "context": "Manually > Requirements",
      "contextHash": "d54f84041972f07b2de72a48adc38f1372b983eb4850a29cbb920a2cd191b9fa",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Triliumはnode.jsアプリケーションです。サポートされている（テスト済みの）node.jsのバージョンは、最新の14.X.Xおよび16.X.Xです。Triliumは古いバージョンでも動作する可能性があります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c0f2af74bbdd866c40bc3df7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "You can check your node version with this command (node.js needs to be installed):",
