    {
      "id": "u_ea8e2b8f0437da9d92cf1c76_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The application by default starts up on port 8080, so you can open your browser and navigate to __TRILIUM_PH_0__http://localhost:8080__TRILIUM_PH_1__ to access Trilium (replace \"localhost\" with your hostname).",
      "sourceHash": "ea8e2b8f0437da9d92cf1c768fdfec9221f61d0d484c7a5dc8863b5af319eb0b",
      "context": "Manually > Run",
      "contextHash": "4c70350b05c239638621092b22aa1b028b2633f1208270b97276e78724abcff5",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "アプリケーションはデフォルトでポート8080で起動するため、ブラウザを開いて __TRILIUM_PH_0__http://localhost:8080__TRILIUM_PH_1__ にアクセスするとTriliumを利用できます（\"localhost\"はお使いのホスト名に置き換えてください）。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_731d7f4d6a3d656fbb488e93_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Once the server is running, the console lists the addresses it can be reached on, including the ones other devices on your network can use.",
